# Copy to .env.local and fill in to get REAL DOT zone numbers instead of estimates.
#
# Free key: create an account at https://labs.rejseplanen.dk/ and request an
# accessId for API 2.0. The app calls Rejseplanen's zoneFromCoordinate service,
# which is the same tariff engine behind the official journey planner and
# returns the genuine DOT zone ids (the DOT001 / DOT054 style values).
#
# Without this, the app falls back to the approximate ring-and-sector model and
# labels every answer "Estimated - not official".
#
# Read server-side only. Never exposed to the browser: see src/app/api/zone/route.ts.

REJSEPLANEN_ACCESS_ID=
